pdate_2026-06-10.md", "timeout_seconds": 600}, "result": "--- task.md ---\n# Community Workshop Room Replan\n\nYou are helping finalize room assignments for three community workshops at Bayview Civic Center.\n\nRead the local planning files in this folder. Create the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder.\n\nWork in two stages:\n\n1. Use the initial planning files to create `answer/initial_room_plan.md`.\n2. If a coordinator update is introduced during the work, use it to create `answer/update_response.md` and `answer/final_room_plan.md`.\n\nThe top-level objective stays the same throughout: leave behind a room assignment package for all three sessions. Use local files only.\n\n--- 00_room_request.md ---\n# Room Request\n\nRequest date: 2026-06-03\n\nBayview Civic Center needs a room assignment packet for three community workshops on 2026-06-18.\n\nThe packet should assign one room to each session in `02_sessions.csv`, keep total room cost at or below `$800`, and make any later coordinator update easy to apply without discarding correct completed work.\n\nIf a newer facility update conflicts with an older room note, use the newer dated facility update for room availability.\n\n--- 01_planning_rules.md ---\n# Planning Rules\n\nEffective date: 2026-06-03\n\n## Source Reliability\n\n- Use the newest dated facility source for room availability when facility notes conflict.\n- Session requirements in `02_sessions.csv` control capacity, time block, equipment, and room-trait needs.\n- Room traits and base costs come from `03_room_options.csv` unless a newer facility update changes room availability.\n\n## Hard Requirements\n\n- Assign every session to exactly one room.\n- Use rooms that are available for the session time block.\n- Room capacity must be at least the session attendee count.\n- If a session needs a projector, demo table, quiet room, or loading access, the assigned room must provide it.\n- Total room cost must be at or below `$800`.\n- Prefer the lowest-cost valid room for each session unless preserving a correct existing assignment after an update is more important.\n\n## Replanning Rule\n\nIf a coordinator update makes part of the initial plan invalid, repair only the affected part when possible. Preserve correct assignments that still satisfy all requirements.\n\n--- 02_sessions.csv ---\nsession_id,session,attendees,time_block,needs_projector,needs_demo_table,needs_quiet_room,needs_loading_access\nS-101,Safety Orientation,22,morning,yes,no,no,no\nS-102,Inventory Lab,16,afternoon,yes,yes,no,yes\nS-103,Benefits Clinic,12,morning,no,no,yes,no\n\n--- 03_room_options.csv ---\nroom,capacity,available_time_blocks,projector,demo_table,quiet_room,loading_access,cost\nHarbor Hall,30,morning;afternoon,yes,no,no,no,300\nBay Workshop,18,afternoon,yes,yes,no,yes,250\nCedar Room,16,morning;afternoon,no,no,yes,no,150\nDelta Annex,20,afternoon,yes,yes,no,yes,320\nElm Room,14,morning;afternoon,no,no,yes,no,125\n\n--- 04_initial_facility_note_2026-06-01.md ---\n# Initial Facility Note\n\nDate: 2026-06-01\n\nAll rooms listed in `03_room_options.csv` are available for booking on 2026-06-18.\n\nBay Workshop is the lowest-cost room with a demo table, projector, and loading access for an afternoon lab.\n\nDelta Annex is also available for the afternoon, but it costs more than Bay Workshop and should be treated as a backup unless another source changes availability.\n\n--- staged_update/05_facility_update_2026-06-10.md ---\n# Facility Update\n\nDate: 2026-06-10\n\nBay Workshop is closed for floor repair on 2026-06-18 and cannot host the Inventory Lab.\n\nDelta Annex has been released for general booking on 2026-06-18 afternoon. It has projector, demo table, and loading access available for the Inventory Lab.\n\nHarbor Hall and Elm Room availability is unchanged.\n\nThe workshop objective has not changed: cover all three sessions with valid rooms and stay within the `$800` ceiling."}, {"func